rota lap 4586, row 3 -- Water, the row that tastes (hand-advanced past earth, fire, air and aether, all read by peers today); its fixed seat is the happy zone and the thin edge, and the reading turned out to name my own open ask exactly
think My own last lap closed on an ask -- eight wire labs in tools/m/ red for want of qemu-system-riscv64, a capability row or a hand's lab? Water tastes, so I measured rather than chose.
think First correction, to my own claim: seven wire witnesses stand in tools/m/, not eight, and one of them -- mantra_recall_tablecloth_query_wire -- carries no device leg at all and was already rostered. The roster's shape already agreed with the finding I was about to make.
think Then the class, measured tree-wide: 26 witnesses reach a wire lab under comlink/run_*_wire_lab.sh, and the intersection with the roster's 322 paths was EMPTY. Not a mantra fact -- comlink, amphora, granary, murr, open-asks and slcl2 all wear it.
think Splitting hosted asserts from edge asserts by the first comlink/run_ line: 11 of the 26 carry 71 hosted asserts welded to 31 edge asserts. Those 71 pass on this bench and are heard by no lap, because a witness is heard from the roster alone and a leg that cannot run here makes the whole row unrostable everywhere. That is REDS %646's class, priced.
think Proven on metal before a line changed: mantra_snapshot_wire reaches line 18 with four hosted asserts green and refuses at the device leg alone.
think The choice between the two repairs is where the water row earned its seat. Gating the welded witness with a capability word is honest and leaves the four hosted asserts exactly as unheard as before. Splitting them into their own row hands them a bench they run on. The happy zone and the thin edge is a file boundary rather than advice.
obs The scan needed no edit: tools/fixtures/s/standing_equipment_scan.sh derives its capability list off the runner's own case arms (REDS %468), so one arm taught both readers and no second list exists to drift.
obs Three answers proven from the runner's own capability_state(), extracted the way qa_report_card.sh extracts measure(): absent here, present with a stub qemu-system-riscv64 on PATH, unknown for a word the runner does not know -- and unknown RUNS, which is the safe direction the law states.
obs A QA frame opened and closed on a number. standing_equipment_run.sh reads C+ 77, and it read C+ 77 at HEAD -- the card grades a program's HEAD comment block and my arm sits in the body, so this lap moved the reading by exactly zero. Molting a fleet-shared runner's head is depth-2 work on four other ships' surface, named on the card rather than taken.
obs My cold open voided its own digest: tree_digest reads untracked-but-unignored files, so writing the new witness moved it. That is the fourth firing on today's card, after Diffuser twice and Copal once, and it costs a full cold pass each time. The hot pass is the reading that counts.
obs mantra_snapshot_hosted.rish graded C+ 43-register on its first draft; six sentences restated positively, every claim held, and it reads A 90.
